WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.188
To put numbers on it: task time dropped from nine
point six one minutes with generation-probability

00:00:06.268 --> 00:00:10.367
highlighting to eight point five nine minutes with
the edit model,

00:00:10.447 --> 00:00:14.419
a significant difference at p equals zero point
zero zero three.

00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:19.548
Highlighted-token survival fell from seventy-four
percent to thirty-five percent,

00:00:19.628 --> 00:00:22.461
showing far tighter alignment with real edits,

00:00:22.541 --> 00:00:25.057
at p below zero point zero zero zero one.

00:00:25.137 --> 00:00:27.463
And on a seven-point preference scale,

00:00:27.543 --> 00:00:34.427
users rated the edit highlights three point nine
four versus two point eight eight for generation probability,

00:00:34.507 --> 00:00:37.530
significant at p equals zero point zero zero one.
